There, the further action should develop.
A few miles away from the village, a group of goblins are supposed to lurk on the heroes and lure them into an ambush.
I would like to give players the opportunity to resolve the confrontation in a variety of ways: persuading, acting, threatening, recognizing the danger at an early stage, whatever comes to mind for the players.
Group strength: 8 common goblins, 2 with spears, 6 armed with bows and sabers
