Of course, even before my studies, I was also informed about job prospects at the time, but also at that time that I certainly want to study until my doctorate and will.
At the moment, however, I have doubts, especially depressing the job prospects.
On the one hand (Studycheck etc) you always hear great career opportunities and the profession is totally wanted, on the other side you hear again and again from unemployed biologists and unbelievably low-paid jobs.
