Whether as a comforter with a stomachache or just for cuddling – My little heat friend can be used in a variety of ways.
Cherry core cushions are a traditional home remedy for soothing heat applications, as cherry kernels can absorb heat very well and dispense it in a metered manner.
The removable inner cushion is easy to heat in the microwave or oven.
The soft cover makes the application particularly pleasant, so that the little ones feel safe, even if they aren’t doing so well.
The cherry core cushion with cover is suitable as a heat pad exclusively for the following fields of application:
Before heating the pillow, check for untypical odor, stick or incendiary stains and dispose immediately if present.
Please remove the inner cushion for heating from reference beforehand!
Heating in the microwave at max. 300 watts for a maximum of 2 minutes (note information provided by the microwave manufacturer!)
Immediately after heating, distribute the heat evenly in the pillow by shaking
Then place the inner cushion back into the cover.
During the first heatings, the surface can lead to a slight formation of moisture, but this disappears during repeated applications.
Be sure to stick to the indicated heating indications, as longer times or higher energy outputs can lead to damage (risk of inflammation and combustion!).
Before heating the pillow in the microwave, check that a heating of grain products is allowed in the manufacturer’s instructions for use.
After the heated inner cushion has been put back into the cover, please check the temperature of the pillow for suitability for babies (max 43 °C) on your arm bend!
Don't use the pillow for acute and chronic, inflammatory or feverish conditions, circulatory problems, fresh hematomas, bruising and open wounds, as well as people with reduced pain.
In the case of existing skin, heart, veins, diabetes or tumor diseases as well as a pregnancy, please contact a doctor before use.
If seams have opened and loose cores leak, dispose of the product and loose cores immediately and inaccessible to children.
If the product is used in babies under 1 year ago, the child’s temperature should be checked regularly during use to prevent overheating!
All serious incidents arising in connection with the product shall be reported to the manufacturer and to the competent authority of the country in which the user is established.
The cover is detachable and washable at 30 °C in the machine.
Please note the care symbols on the product!
