Rotinger brake discs are designed for the demands of the dynamic driver, who appreciates reliability and safety during braking even under difficult conditions.
Rotinger brake discs are made of casting and then machined mechanically (drilled and cut).
All tuned discs are produced in short series according to individual technical characteristics, which are suitable for certain panes and patterns.
On the basis of the individual technical drawing, a special production program is created, which depends on the properties of the original assembly with the balancing of the pane.
The tuned discs produced in this way ensure high comfort and braking effectiveness.
Additionally created openings increase the effectiveness of the cooling of the disc, whereby the notches improve the cleaning of the brake discs and brake pads.
