I am very disciplined and organized at work (am independent, very little free time), but all my life I have been able to keep my household permanently clean and tidy.
There are always phases in which everything stops, and every now and then it grabs me and I clean up and clean.
But it’s actually never “that someone could spontaneously come to visit.”
